	(text "3V3 branches: RADIO load-switched; GNSS/IMU load-switched then C-FB-C filtered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245 224 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "0f2bc486-9230-4d41-960f-d7b850cfb07f")
	)
	(text "5 V AUX: TPS630701 fixed buck-boost; AUX5_EN controls EN; power-save mode selected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 420 68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "0f9a5871-2ee5-4a35-af45-2c1aca642c25")
	)
	(text "POWER TREE — REGULATOR STAGES\nVSYS_RAW -> U10 (3.3 V) -> +3V3_MAIN; open-drain PG drives BUCK_3V3_PG.\nVSYS_RAW -> U8 (1.8 V) -> +1V8_AON; CTRL = BUCK_3V3_PG with +3V3_MAIN pull-up.\nVSYS_RAW -> U20 (fixed 5 V buck-boost) -> +5V_AUX; AUX5_EN controls EN.\nValidate all rails across the approved loaded 2S operating range and transient cases.\n+1V8_AON -> U11 (PWR_ON enabled) -> +1V8_RUN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "343695a3-c675-4cc0-b0e6-a803db1ce56f")
	)
	(text "1.8 V RUN LOAD SWITCH — TPS22997RYZR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.74 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7dd8dd86-4710-402a-a283-a3f14aa7f11f")
	)
	(text "+1V8_AON -> U11 -> +1V8_RUN; ON = STM32 PWR_ON.\nC192 = 3.9nF: about 1.05ms 10–90% rise at 1.8V.\nQOD tied to VOUT for fast discharge; PG unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.74 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7f8a2a28-e845-4c8a-8717-80e320c0ee0a")
	)
	(text "COMMISSIONING - BQ25798: RPROG=8.2k selects 2S / 750kHz at POR; charge current remains at the 1A default until firmware raises it only after thermal and cell checks pass."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 256 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "832ac448-f10e-4e44-b01d-6a65df9ba660")
	)
	(text "VBUS HOT-PLUG: TVS2200 clamps VBUS_PD and populated 2.2R/2.2uF snubber damps cable ringing; scope and tune after worst-cable testing. TVS2200 is for SPR <=20V / 21V ceiling only - never enable 28V EPR."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 263 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "84e06546-3cfb-4b96-8963-d6ba0689c9f8")
	)
	(text "PMIC_SCL/SDA direct host link is valid across only R13=5mOhm Kelvin shunt; preserve GND1 (cell/CSP) / GND (system/CSN) separation and do not bridge elsewhere."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 235 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "92775cab-a95c-479d-a87c-949be38be77b")
	)
	(text "COMMISSIONING - MAX17320 NVM: before enabling charge, program and validate nPackCfg for 2S (NCELLS=0), one 10k TH1, nRSense=5mOhm, and the selected 21700 cell model/capacity/protection limits. Wiring alone does not define these settings."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 249 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "94ce4467-99a7-44a2-b95c-abfd8dbae25d")
	)
	(text "PACK TEMPERATURE: initial build must thermally couple both NTC1 (MAX17320 TH1) and fitted NTC2 (BQ25798 TS) to the pack. Keep BQ TS_IGNORE=0; configure MAX for the NCP15 10k/B3380 model; validate hot/cold thresholds before raising charge current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 270 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cab8b6a2-477a-4d31-b528-8ac101b6cf83")
	)
	(text "MAX17320 2S: CELL1=cell midpoint; CELL2=CELL3=BATTS=filtered pack top, per datasheet Figure 24 / Note 10."
